# Phase 6: a thread that overflows its kernel stack runs into the guard page
# and is reported cleanly (double fault on its own stack, with the thread and
# the guard page named).
lumen kernel shell
!send test exceptions so
!wait 2
test exceptions: triggering so
starting a thread that recurses without end
*** EXCEPTION 8: #DF Double Fault ***
thread: runaway
double fault; last page-fault address
kernel stack overflow:
is in the guard page below the stack at
RIP=
recurse_forever
backtrace:
recurse_forever
System halted.
